  "markdown": "[Skip to main content](https://avispl.com/services/real-time-design/#main-content)\n\nYour browser does not support the video tag.\n\n\nThis is a video titled: vr 25 website video header 1920×1080. If no captions are visible, ensure they are enabled in the video player.\n\n\n# Real-Time  Design\n\nVisualize your spaces and technology before you build\n\nScroll to bottom of the hero section\n\n[![Real-Time Design Overview](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Real-Time-Design-Overview-scaled.jpg)](https://vimeo.com/1191900624?share=copy&fl=sv&fe=ci)\n\n### Test room designs before you invest\n\nAccelerate planning and build buy-in with our Real-Time Design approach. Our visualization process engages multiple stakeholders, focusing on the often-overlooked end user, in human-centric design thinking.\n\n[Schedule a demo](https://avispl.com/services/real-time-design/#contact)\n\n## Virtual spaces\n\nSee how AVI-SPL visualizes and refines the digital workplace experience in the 3D virtual designs below. After, reach out to us to learn how we can support your design choices and help produce meaningful results.\n\n- Native conference rooms\n- Team collaborating and training\n- Small spaces\n- Work spaces\n- Specialty Spaces\n- Extra Large Environments\n\nNative conference rooms\nTeam collaborating and training\nSmall spaces\nWork spaces\nSpecialty Spaces\nExtra Large Environments\n\n#### Native conference rooms\n\n[![Large conference room with a long table facing two wall-mounted digital displays](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Large_Conf_Room_Dual_v01.modus_1-300x169.jpg)\\\\\n**Microsoft Teams Rooms**](https://v.modusvr.com/_lskRaBC4B)\n\n[![Large conference room with Cisco equipment.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Large-Conference-Room-Cisco-300x169.jpg)\\\\\n**Cisco Workspaces**](https://v.modusvr.com/oYK0mBJPKN)\n\n[![Small meeting space with two wall-mounted displays, a conference table, seating, and wheelchair.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/PPMP-Shure_V2.modus_0-300x169.jpg)\\\\\n**Zoom room**](https://v.modusvr.com/n4TGCrMcmm)\n\n#### Team collaborating and training\n\n[![Training environment with two large wall-mounted video walls and PTZ cameras. Rendering shows the visual dispersion of audio throughout the space.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Divide-Combine.modus_5-300x169.jpg)\\\\\n**Divisible multipurpose room**](https://v.modusvr.com/GJmRf3iJ7G)\n\n[![A large open space with multiple projection screens and tables dedicated to each screen. Virtual people sit at these tables.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Debranded-MPR.modus_0-300x169.jpg)\\\\\n**Multipurpose Room**](https://v.modusvr.com/q1qDjqJbQu)\n\n[![Large conference room with a long table facing two wall-mounted digital displays with displays and cameras on side walls.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Crestron-PPMP-Lrg-300x169.jpeg)\\\\\n**Large Conference Room**](https://v.modusvr.com/iPTtZNmLnu)\n\n#### Small spaces\n\n[![Cisco huddle room with three virtual people speaking toward the wall-mounted display and video bar.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/RefDesign_Cisco_v02.modus_8-300x169.jpg)\\\\\n**Huddle room**](https://v.modusvr.com/LykBRYrVA_)\n\n[![empty conference room with laptop on a table and a display on the back wall.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Small_13x17_v01-RTD.modus_8-300x169.jpg)\\\\\n**Small hybrid conference room**](https://v.modusvr.com/q2W1ggdOK6)\n\n#### Work spaces\n\n[![Three-row control room widescreen video wall featuring multiple content streams.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Control-Room-v02.modus_6-1-300x169.jpg)\\\\\n**Control rooms**](https://v.modusvr.com/KuR6FxiKX2)\n\n[![Medical simulation lab with digital displays on walls and PTZ cameras hanging from the ceiling.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/WetLab_01A_v02.modus_0-300x169.png)\\\\\n**Medical Simulation**](https://v.modusvr.com/o4Aw8Kqxtv)\n\n[![Broadcast control room viewing a small production studio with a green screen.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/ISE-IC_2025_LiveDemo_v01.modus_0-300x169.jpg)\\\\\n**XR Studio**](https://v.modusvr.com/WNwdFxtu0Y)\n\n#### Specialty Spaces\n\n[![Sustainable lobby environment with green carpeting and wall and ceiling hung foliage.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/ISE-26-Multi-Vendor-PPMP_V10.modus_0-300x169.jpg)\\\\\n**Lobby**](https://v.modusvr.com/ENha2JYSq8)\n\n[![Purple lighting and a curved video wall radiate from the walls and ceiling in a workplace common area.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Immersive_experimental-ceiling.modus_3-300x169.jpg)\\\\\n**Immersive Exhibits**](https://v.modusvr.com/5L-nP9oWKx)\n\n#### Extra Large Environments\n\n[![Horseshoe conference room facing a widescreen wall display.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/RefDesign_Cisco_v02.modus_5-300x169.jpeg)\\\\\n**Executive Boardroom**](https://v.modusvr.com/CsaUQkp-Rn)\n\n[![Extra-large conference room with a long table. Attendees have individual confidence monitors and microphones. Table faces a large wall-mounted display at the end of the room.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Executive_BR_v01.modus_7-300x170.jpg)\\\\\n**Intelligent Camera Systems**](https://v.modusvr.com/Yo9irLNIiE)\n\n![Signature Microsoft Teams Room in VR Design](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Signature-Microsoft-Teams-Room-in-VR-Design.png)\n\n### Watch our Real-Time Design approach in action with leading providers\n\n### Click the logos to get started.\n\n[![cisco partner logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Cisco-partner-large-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/cisco/)\n\n[![crestron logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Creston-colour-2.svg)](https://avispl.com/crestron/)\n\n[![HP Poly logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/HP-Poly-logo-5-25.svg)](https://avispl.com/hp-poly/)\n\n[![Huddly logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/huddly-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/huddly/)\n\n[![logitech logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/logitech-small.svg)](https://avispl.com/logitech/)\n\n[![Neat logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Neat-logo.svg)](https://avispl.com/neat/)\n\n[![Q-SYS logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Q-SYS_logo-SVG.svg)](https://avispl.com/q-sys/)\n\n[![Shure logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/shure-100-large-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/shure/)",
